 computation and&lt;br&gt;communication, coalesced memory access,&lt;br&gt;and fewer stalls, bank conflicts, launch overhead." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Source Sans 3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="562" y="132.8" width="246" height="57.6" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="roofline-x2681" parent="roofline-figure" value="&lt;b&gt;move right, increase Arithmetic Intensity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(FLOPs/byte):&lt;/b&gt; larger batch, more tokens per pass,&lt;br&gt;quantization, operator fusion, smaller or&lt;br&gt;quantized KV cache (GQA, MLA)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Source Sans 3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="562" y="232.8" width="240.07" height="57.6" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="roofline-x2682" parent="roofline-figure" value="&lt;b&gt;ML model improvements&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;may not move the point:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;smaller models, sparse attention" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Source Sans 3;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="377.5" y="203.2" width="164.5" height="43.2" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="matmul-label" value="matmul.svg" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Source Sans 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
